language.string:
Rho Viewer Portable {0}
Read, preview, and export KartRider .rho, .rho5, and .lpk archives. Browse, analyze, preview, and export resources, and update game files.
Audio is extracted to a temporary file and opened with portable\Players or the Windows default player. Format decoding references xpoi5010/Kartrider-File-Reader. See THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.txt for third-party sources and the GPL-3.0 license.
